# Job-hunt loop schedule. Times are Perth (TZ=Australia/Perth in the container).
# Off the hour on purpose. Each script takes a lock, so runs never overlap.
# Scripts are started with bash so this also works on a Windows-mounted folder (no exec bit).
20 7 * * *        bash /work/bin/run-digest.sh
40 7,12,17 * * *  bash /work/bin/run-cycle.sh
10 8,13,18 * * *  bash /work/bin/run-submit.sh
